# Strict allowlist: the Dockerfile's `COPY . .` would otherwise ship worktrees,
# vendored skills, operational state and gitignored local evidence to the daemon.
# Deny everything, then re-admit exactly what the image needs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!scripts/
!tests/
!configs/
!data/GATED_DATA_POINTERS.json
!data/access_posture.json
!data/FROZEN_ARTIFACTS.json
# Never, even when admitted by a parent rule above:
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.parquet
**/.omc
**/.worktrees
